Zeus is right over here!

302
00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:26.130
Pay-Pay! That's the way!

303
00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:28.960
Can't you do that
down a different hallway,

304
00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:29.960
