305
00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:31.590
What was that, Pay-Pay?

306
00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:34.510
How about you say that
to my cute little face!

307
00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:40.480
How heartless!

308
00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:43.730
Would you treat me
like this if I was dying?

309
00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:46.280
Poor widdle Ulti!

310
00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:47.740
Don't be like that.

311
00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:49.730
If you're so tired,
just sit there!

312
00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:50.030
That's not what
you're s'posed to say!

313
00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:53.080
That's not what
you're supposed to say!

314
00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:55.240
Ah, crap!

315
00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:56.000
This is the part where you offer

316
00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.200
This is the part you offer

317
00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.710
to give me a piggyback ride!

318
00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:01.940
<b>Ulti and Page One
Soaring Six
Beast Pirates</b>

319
00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.750
Stop! Ease your grip!

320
00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:05.550
– Sis! Please!
– Say you're sorry!

321
00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:06.880
– Say you're sorry!
– Come on!

322
00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:07.550
Come on! Stop messing around!

323
00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:09.680
Stop messing around!

324
00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:12.760
Pay-Pay?

325
00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:19.020
You gotta stay with me, dammit!

326
00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:19.660
Oh, my poor, sweet
little Pay-Pay! Oh no!

327
00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:22.660
My poor, sweet
little baby brother!

328
00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:27.110
What was that?

329
00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:32.500
Here lies

330
00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:37.570
He sacrificed his life for his
favorite person in the world!

331
00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:43.010
Huh? Can't you see
I'm grieving here?

332
00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:45.580
Who the heck are you?

333
00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:58.950
That has
to be Onigashima.

334
00:16:58.950 --> 00:16:59.910
Hm?

335
00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:01.530
You

336
00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:03.740
Curse you, King.

337
00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.840
And that damn Straw Hat.

338
00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:10.800
Mama's alliance, be damned.

339
00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:14.340
I'm going to wreak havoc
as soon as I get there!

340
00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.060
Anyone who dares to cross us

341
00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:19.430
will get the worst
licking of their lives!

342
00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.120
Actually, wait a second.

343
00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.200
There's a problem.

344
00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:27.160
I'm pretty sure Big Mom was
headed towards Nami's group!

345
00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:29.960
She's probably gonna
try to take back Zeus.

346
00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.750
So that means they're in danger.

347
00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:33.500
Musta been the damage
we just took.

348
00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.460
I think it accidentally
activated

349
00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:36.940
