350
00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:38.860
Don't worry,
they're gonna be fine.

351
00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:39.740
Sanji's with them, remember?

352
00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.400
Hey, you're choking me!

353
00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:41.980
I guess you're right.

354
00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:44.100
Although, I hope
he doesn't get distracted

355
00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:48.110
