can focus on saving Momonosuke!

356
00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:50.320
That is the risk
with him, unfortunately.

357
00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:53.200
Well. Let's just
hope for the best.

358
00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:55.990
All right!
At least Kin'emon's group

359
00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:58.000
