372
00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:47.120
Yes, and you, candle!

373
00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.000
Oh, lantern!

374
00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:01.340
Join me and
I'll give you all life!

375
00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:05.550
