Is that overripe mature woman
really as dangerous as they say?

383
00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:28.280
She's all that and
then some, I promise you.

384
00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:30.830
Hold on. Wasn't Sanji
supposed to be here with us?

385
00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.130
Sanji?

386
00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:36.170
Yeah. I think?

387
00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:38.130
Sorry for making you worry.

388
00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:38.170
I'll find those lovely ladies
no matter what!

389
00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:41.710
I'll find those lovely
ladies no matter what!

390
00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:45.510
Dependable
as ever, I guess!

391
00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:46.950
We'll just have to run.

392
00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:47.470
Run

393
00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:50.390
We still have a mission
to rescue Lord Momonosuke!

394
00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:54.180
'Kay!

395
00:19:57.350 --> 00:20:00.980
Hey! Mama! Over this way!

396
00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:06.240
There's no
need to rush.

397
00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:09.360
