is up ahead, correct?

398
00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:11.660
They'll be right
where we want 'em.

399
00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:23.280
I'm seeing people with
weird abilities everywhere I go.

400
00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:29.170
Just call us Gifters.

401
00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:33.450
We all, at one time,
shared that same desire.

402
00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:35.250
Every one of us.

403
00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:37.610
Things will be so much easier

404
00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.380
