412
00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:58.850
I'm sure they can make it
through on their own,

413
00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:59.700
<b>Wire
Kid Pirates Heat
Kid Pirates</b>

414
00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:02.190
but we gotta stick together
till we meet up again.

415
00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:02.360
If I kill you,
I'll get promoted for sure!

416
00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:04.610
I'll get promoted for sure.

417
00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.730
Nothing personal, of course!

418
00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:11.630
Please stop!

419
00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:13.210
The commander
is looking for you!

420
00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:13.250
Leave me alone, all right?

421
00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.500
choking me!

422
00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:16.960
I've got places to be!

423
00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.380
Young Master! Please wait!

424
00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:21.340
If you let your guard down,

425
00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:23.180
