Be careful of him, all right?

458
00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:33.740
Yeah, got it.

459
00:23:39.460 --> 00:23:41.540
Wanna help, Pay-Pay?

460
00:23:41.540 --> 00:23:42.880
Sure.

461
00:24:11.530 --> 00:24:15.080
