470
00:24:31.260 --> 00:24:33.340
Shut your damn mouth!

471
00:24:34.220 --> 00:24:36.810
I can make up my own mind.

472
00:24:36.810 --> 00:24:40.810
And we already decided that
this guy's a dangerous enemy!

473
00:24:40.810 --> 00:24:41.850
I dunno, ma'am!

474
00:24:41.850 --> 00:24:43.310
He looks pretty dead to me.

475
00:24:43.310 --> 00:24:45.270
You cracked his head open!

476
00:24:51.070 --> 00:24:53.570
Then where the hell is
all that Haki coming from, huh?

477
00:24:53.570 --> 00:24:56.410
That hurt! Hey!

478
00:24:57.090 --> 00:25:00.220
Gum-Gum...

479
00:25:00.220 --> 00:25:02.480
...Elephant Gun!

480
00:25:03.670 --> 00:25:06.250
You guys are tougher
than you look.

481
00:25:06.250 --> 00:25:08.260
Didn't see that coming.

482
00:25:09.100 --> 00:25:12.480
Guess I underestimated you.

483
00:25:12.480 --> 00:25:14.440
It won't happen again.

484
00:25:16.320 --> 00:25:19.360
This is an Emperor's
home turf after all.

485
00:25:22.190 --> 00:25:25.360
Listen up, shitheads!

486
00:25:25.170 --> 00:25:31.090
<b>Performance

Floor



Skull Dome</b>

487
00:25:25.360 --> 00:25:28.200
Sorry to interrupt your
scheduled drinking,

488
00:25:28.200 --> 00:25:31.700
