514
00:29:21.400 --> 00:29:22.530
Master Yamato!

515
00:29:22.530 --> 00:29:23.780
Seize them!

516
00:29:30.320 --> 00:29:34.430
Forgive me!
I swear, I mean you no harm!

517
00:29:37.890 --> 00:29:40.900
All right.
Y'seem like a good person,

518
00:29:40.900 --> 00:29:42.440
but put me down.

519
00:29:42.440 --> 00:29:45.610
You hear me?
There's something I gotta do!

520
00:29:45.940 --> 00:29:48.570
The day has finally come!

521
00:29:49.660 --> 00:29:53.330
Now, I understand
this may sound odd.

522
00:29:53.330 --> 00:29:57.000
But I've anticipated this
for quite some time.

523
00:29:57.800 --> 00:30:00.740
I've been waiting for you!

524
00:30:07.290 --> 00:30:13.350
My name is Yamato!
I'm Kaido's son!
